sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant FE as Login dialog
  participant API as /api/auth
  participant Mail as Resend
  participant G as Google
  participant DB as Supabase Auth
  participant CLI as Friday X (terminal / editor)

  alt Email and password
    U->>FE: Email + password
    FE->>API: POST /login
    API->>DB: Check password
    API->>Mail: Send 6-digit OTP
    U->>FE: Enter OTP
    FE->>API: POST /verify-otp
    API-->>FE: Session JWT
  else Google
    U->>FE: Continue with Google
    FE->>API: GET /auth/google/start
    API->>G: OAuth consent
    G-->>API: Code
    API->>DB: Create or reuse user
    API-->>FE: Hash friday_session
    FE->>FE: Store JWT locally
  else Company SSO
    U->>FE: Continue with Company SSO
    FE->>SSO: SSO_ENTRY_URL
  else Terminal or editor (Friday X)
    U->>CLI: friday login
    CLI->>API: POST /api/x/oauth2/device/code
    CLI->>U: Opens /device, shows a code
    U->>FE: Signs in as above, checks the code, Approve
    FE->>API: POST /api/x/auth/device/approve
    CLI->>API: Poll /oauth2/token
    API-->>CLI: Revocable fxt_ token (scoped to /api/x)
  end
